  "body_html": "<p>Transform any bedroom into an exciting sports haven with this personalized basketball comforter from Jeminise. Featuring a dynamic sports design, this bedding is perfect for basketball players, fans, and kids who love the game. Customization options allow you to easily add your own name and number for a truly unique and thoughtful gift.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Custom options let you personalize the bedding set with your own Name and Number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Made from soft, comfy, and lightweight 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features tight, smooth, fine, and compact stitching along the edges with environmental protection dyeing techniques to prevent fading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water. Dries quickly on low or no heat and fluffs up beautifully after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Components:</strong> Complete your bedding setup with options for matching pillowcases and a flat sheet cover.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball D4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Compact</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Art, Number, Personalized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
